# BigSpeshl-GUARD

BigSpeshl-GUARD is an autonomous Python-based DDOS defense and network threat mitigation system. It is inspired by the design principles behind NetGuard-Pro but built as a lightweight, terminal-first tool focused on detection heuristics, auto-blocking, and live CLI monitoring.

## Features

- Real-time traffic event analysis
- Adaptive detection for SYN flood, UDP reflection, and HTTP flood patterns
- Automatic IP blocking and rate limiting
- Rich terminal interface with a branded BigSpeshl-GUARD banner
- Built-in simulation scenarios for testing defensive logic

## Quick start

Requires Python 3.9+.

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python -m bigspeshl_guard --interactive
```

## Example commands

```bash
python -m bigspeshl_guard --mode syn_flood --duration 12
python -m bigspeshl_guard --status
python -m bigspeshl_guard --interactive
```

## Disclaimer

This software is for authorized testing and educational use only. Do not deploy it against systems without explicit permission.
